13. The method of claim 1, where providing the search results includes:
causing a search to be performed based on the search query to identify a plurality of search result documents;
receiving the search results based on the plurality of search result documents, at least a subset of the search results including a text excerpt from a corresponding subset of the plurality of search result documents;
receiving the expanded text excerpt for the at least one of the search results; and
causing the search results and the expanded text excerpt to be presented on a display associated with the one or more devices.
